    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_credits">Made by BookahCoding. Theme colours come from the Hikyaku and Herald design tokens (MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2026 Giton22). Calendar files are read with biweekly (BSD-2-Clause) and the network with OkHttp (Apache-2.0). The month pictures are AI-generated ukiyo-e style artwork made with Grok by the app owner and released under the same MIT licence as the code; no museum image is used. This app contacts only your Nextcloud server and the feed addresses you add, GitHub when you tap "Check for updates" (released builds only), and, if you set a place for the weather, Open-Meteo (open-meteo.com, data under CC BY 4.0), which receives only the coordinates of that place. It has no analytics and uploads no crash reports.</string>
